#: ../../using/configure.rst:116
msgid ""
"See :option:`--with-readline` for choosing the backend for the "
":mod:`readline` module."
msgstr "请参阅 :option:`--with-readline` 了解如何为 :mod:`readline` 模块选择后端。"

#: ../../using/configure.rst:118
